  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Colour of the compounds is due to transition of electrons.</p><p>Cyanides are not yellow.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>BaCrO</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>Yellow</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>K</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>Co</mtext> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>NO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>6</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>Yellow</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>NH</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>As</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>Mo</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>Yellow</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is bluish white.</p>",
